ext":"因为上帝在义人当中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们恶人羞辱困苦人的计划，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华是他们的避难所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿以色列的拯救来自锡安！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华救回祂被掳的子民时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各要欢喜，以色列要快乐。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}